<title>UK: China prices 500 mln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>China prices 500 mln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHINA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    26.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.859   PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.659    SPREAD	+55 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB+	DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  CHINA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.70	LISTING FEE 0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 122</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
